### Auth.js / NextAuth
AUTH_SECRET=replace_me_with_a_strong_random_secret
AUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000

### Google OAuth (YouTube scopes are requested in `auth.ts`)
AUTH_GOOGLE_ID=replace_me
AUTH_GOOGLE_SECRET=replace_me

### YouTube Data API
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=replace_me

### Database (Supabase Postgres recommended)
# Example format:
# postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/DATABASE?schema=public
DATABASE_URL=replace_me

